    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was a good night for Chika Chosokabe.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She was taking either a step forward or backward depending on your motivations for being here and, for the first moment since her tongue departed her good friend’s clitoris, she was actually kind of happy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She wasn’t happy in the sense that things were going well, though. Just that they weren’t getting any worse. And that they probably couldn’t get any worse unless her boyfriend started fucking her little sister too.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if chinamicthree == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was a possibility, she thought. She hadn’t forgotten the time he brought her name up during discussions of a potential threesome, despite how much she wanted to.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That would be rock bottom, though. She’d probably just die if things ever came to that. But things would obviously never come to that because she had just solved everything!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She’d managed to confront him and partially explain her stance and mindset in a mostly mature way, reminiscent of the way she used to be before the worm of Giles Corey began to eat away at her brain.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene hypercube1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/hypercube1.webp",
      "alt": "hypercube1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But it all felt too easy. It all felt too simple. Which meant it all felt so wrong.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This wasn’t the type of issue that could be solved in a single talk on the way home from work. This would require tears. Pain. Memories of hints that sneak in before late night panic attacks in the bathroom.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She was far too coherent for any of it to feel real.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which, in turn, led to her questioning just how much of what she knew was actually fake.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene hypercube2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/hypercube2.webp",
      "alt": "hypercube2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami! I’m home!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, big sis Chika! Chinami missed you while you were at work today!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, good. She wasn’t being fucked.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
