    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But she was being different.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What a silly girl she was — always using her femur to bash the dinner bell. Idling like the bed of Jesus as she gazes out the window, dreaming of peanuts and pancakes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you doing, weirdo? Come give me a hug.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, big sis Chika! Chinami missed you while you were at work today!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...yeah. Big sis Chika missed you too. And guess what? She ran into Papa on the way home. And she thinks she’s going to start trying to act a little more like her old self again so-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, big sis Chika! Chinami missed you while you were at work today!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you okay?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
