    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, big sis Chika! Chinami missed you while you were at work today!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Chinami has said that many times now. Which means Chika is worried Chinami is sleepwalking again.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She used her hand to shoulder. An act of reassurance. The kind that Mom would bake.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, big sis Chika! Chinami missed you while you were at work today!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
