      "alt": "hypercube5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But when that shoulderbird don’t sing, we’re left to question how to make-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami...come on. Stop acting weird.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Coffee in each glorious way — each melodious aroma misconstrued.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome home, big sis Chika! Chinami missed you while you were at work today!",
      "spk": "Chinami",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "With the creaking of seventh step, you’ll see what I am to you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami. Wake up. You’re doing it again.",
