    {
      "en": "She approaches the cube, which remains perfectly still. The way it always has. The way it always will.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She gazes into its depths, uncovering secrets of the earth’s formation. Every way to brew coffee. How to make yourself look even more beautiful for the person you love.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There are so many answers packed inside that she can’t figure out what to ask.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So she defaults to what an earlier voice told her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
