    {
      "en": "As the pungent stenches of sex and body odor assault her senses, however, she can do little more than stand there in shock.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So many penises! So many vaginas! So much moaning and groaning, turning and churning!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But while her heart’s quickly burning, she’s suddenly learning that she hasn’t been crazy at all!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "One more misbegotten beguiling for the pile, she smiles — scribbling neatly of self-deceit on the back of a treat receipt before begrudgingly smudging her words in defeat. That cheat!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He had swooned her! Groomed her! Touched her from her head to her feet! Yet he’s been out on the street, calling others his sweet, while she slaved over a stove so her sister could eat?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No! Unacceptable! But sad. So sad. She was so very, sad. She knew he meant no wrong! Sex is like bowling for adults. She just needed to get better at it. And she was in just the right place to do that.",
      "zh": ""
